{"availability":"available","full":"choganhq/chogan","name":"chogan","description":"Offline game collection: tower defence, sudoku, minesweeper, dots and boxes. Free, open source, no ads, no trackers. — مجموعه‌بازی آفلاین چوگان: رایگان، متن‌باز، بدون تبلیغ و بدون ردیاب.","category":"Developer tools","language":"HTML","stars":59,"forks":4,"created":"2026-09-05T08:21:17Z","updated":"2026-10-15T23:55:16Z","license":"MIT","branch":"main","homepage":"https://choganhq.github.io/chogan/","topics":["android","capacitor","farsi","fdroid","games","minesweeper","no-ads","offline","open-source","persian","pwa","sudoku","tower-defense","vanilla-javascript"],"demo":"https://choganhq.github.io/chogan/","color":"#63362a","ink":"#f8c7a8","lastCheckedAt":"2026-10-16T21:35:08.459Z","lastAttemptAt":"2026-10-16T21:35:08.459Z","lastAvailableAt":"2026-10-16T21:35:08.459Z","metrics":[{"at":"2026-10-10T05:44:07.011Z","stars":41,"forks":4},{"at":"2026-10-15T19:29:55.110Z","stars":58,"forks":4},{"at":"2026-10-16T21:35:08.459Z","stars":59,"forks":4}],"technologies":[],"overview":{"kind":"readme","version":1,"paragraphs":["Chogan is a small collection of finishable games in a single app. Free, open source, no ads, no in-app purchases, no analytics or trackers, and fully offline.","The Android manifest declares VIBRATE and nothing else — not even internet access, because nothing in the app ever touches the network. Fonts, sounds and every asset ship inside the package; sound is generated procedurally with WebAudio, so there is not a single audio file in the build. Progress is stored on the device only, and Google auto-backup is turned off."],"features":["Web: choganhq.github.io/chogan, installable as an app from the browser.","Android: F-Droid, or the APK on the Releases page.","Telegram: @chogangamebot opens the web version inside Telegram."],"sourceUrl":"https://github.com/choganhq/chogan/blob/main/README.md","fingerprint":"637e1c227b207637c437dfbfe30f80d23544140ee61678dc20318c61d8ba6475","ext